                    coach_r2_diffuse: "<strong>Spread too thin.</strong> Opening up to this many people uses most of the ten days, and no one gets the full story. Roche has told it so often that it is turning into a script.",
                    carry_note_1: "The room has already seen one round go unresolved: it credits this round's gains at three quarters of their weight.",
