                    db_sponsor: "Round 2 — leaning on the former manager alone. The most powerful person available is also the one tied to the identity she is trying to leave behind.",
                    db_ask: "Round 2 — the ask was for advice, reassurance or rescue, not for a place to work through the anxiety before deciding. A good choice of person can be undone by what is asked of them.",
